{"dog":{"age_group":"adult","application_url":"https://www.nycacc.org/adopt/adoption-process/","availability_detail":"available","breed_display":"Domestic Short Hair Cross","breed_primary":"Domestic Short Hair Cross","description_text":"My foster writes:\nMarley is bonded to her brother Alex and they make quite the dynamic duo. They enjoy play wrestling and relaxing together for very funny and entertaining viewing. Marley can be more nervous around new people and new surroundings, but the way to her heart is crunchy treats and playtime.\nMarley is a bit more independent and gives you your space during the day to get work done. However, she remains a good supervisor kitty and likes to check in by doing the very important task of taking a nap behind you. Her favorite sleeping positions are to be fully stretched out on the bed, sleeping with one paw covering her face, or staring at you upside down with her very adorable little face. Ideally, Marley should be going to an adult only home that is quiet and patient.","detail_url":"https://nycaccpets.shelterbuddy.com/animal/animalDetails.asp?s=adoption&searchTypeId=4&animalType=2%2C15&pagesize=75&task=view&tpage=3&searchType=4&animalid=186367","id":"304139ec266a62d0bb08f9cab01abf14","image_urls":["https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/f3f1d69187e74496a553489b66822323-1755697314-1755697350-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/c1980f465cf74aa0b270e5235219df39-1755697314-1755697314-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/e75bf34506ad45ff9830badb1b465e72-1755697314-1755697314-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/14e1987d65bb4ac4bbb1807aa3a52a41-1755697314-1755697314-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/cd3fe968ce4a4ba29b514aeb149213e9-1749749748-1749749748-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/b40c84b2a9554009b283b5c7838e6450-1749749747-1749749747-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/imag